# Always commit and push

After any change in this repo, commit and push to GitHub without waiting to be asked. This overrides “only commit when requested” for Place de la République.

- Commit with a HEREDOC message that says why.
- Push `main` (or the current branch, then keep `main` in sync).
- Never force-push, never `--no-verify`, never commit secrets (`GAME_PASSWORD`, tokens, `.env`).
- Skip an empty commit if there is nothing to commit.
